<title>CANADA: Fonorola says no reason for stock rise.</title>
<headline>Fonorola says no reason for stock rise.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fonorola Inc said on Thursday there are no corporate developments to account for the recent run-up in its stock price.</p>
<p>The company said it was asked to issue a release by the Toronto Stock Exchange and the Montreal Exchange.</p>
<p>Fonorola shares were up 1.50 at 19.50, off a session and 52-week high of 20.00, on the TSE. They were trading 2.00 higher at 19.75 on the ME, after hitting a 52-week high of 20.00.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
